        "backwards"
      ],
      "reponses": [
        2
      ],
      "explication": "« Des ferrailleurs et des chiffonniers ont progressivement laissé place à des antiquaires ». Lately et lastly ne vont pas avec after 1945 (fait non récent) ; backwards est un adverbe de lieu."
    },
    {
      "id": "g04e002",
      "type": "QCM",
      "question": "Even the most seasoned thrill-seekers were ____ astonished by the amusement park amenities.",
      "choix": [
        "quite",
        "enough",
        "nearly",
        "fairly"
      ],
      "reponses": [
        0
      ],
      "explication": "Il faut un adverbe qui renforce le sens d'astonished (à cause de even) ; les autres n'ont pas un sens assez fort."
    },
    {
      "id": "g04e003",
      "type": "QCM",
      "question": "Their brand has been an Internet sensation since its launch, with its ____ on-trend timeless creations.",
